# The Oblivion Ring ruling (CR 607.2a, 603.6c): Bot2 Disenchants the Ring in response to its enters ability. The Ring's
# leaves ability triggers and resolves first, and returns nothing - nothing has been exiled with it yet. Then the enters
# ability resolves and exiles Bot2's Ornithopter, with nothing left to ever bring it back.

